{
  "mark.8.p1.b1": {
    "text": "那时，又有许多人聚集，并没有什么吃的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那⁠时，又⁠有许⁠多人聚⁠集，并没⁠有什⁠么吃的。"
  },
  "mark.8.p1.b2": {
    "text": "我怜悯这众人；因为他们同我在这里已经三天，也没有吃的了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我怜⁠悯这众⁠人；因⁠为他⁠们同我⁠在这⁠里已⁠经三⁠天，也⁠没⁠有吃的了。"
  },
  "mark.8.p1.b3": {
    "text": "我若打发他们饿着回家，就必在路上困乏，因为其中有从远处来的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我若打⁠发他⁠们饿着回⁠家，就必在路⁠上困⁠乏，因⁠为其⁠中有从远⁠处来的。"
  },
  "mark.8.p2.b1": {
    "text": "在这野地，从哪里能得饼，叫这些人吃饱呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "在这野⁠地，从哪⁠里能得饼，叫这⁠些人吃饱呢？"
  },
  "mark.8.p2.b2": {
    "text": "你们有多少饼？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们有多⁠少饼？"
  },
  "mark.8.p2.b3": {
    "text": "七个。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "七⁠个。"
  },
  "mark.8.p3.b1": {
    "text": "他吩咐众人坐在地上，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他吩⁠咐众⁠人坐⁠在地⁠上，"
  },
  "mark.8.p3.b2": {
    "text": "就拿着这七个饼祝谢了，擘开，递给门徒，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就⁠拿着这七⁠个饼祝谢了，擘开，递给门⁠徒，"
  },
  "mark.8.p3.b3": {
    "text": "又有几条小鱼；耶稣祝了福，就吩咐也摆在众人面前。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "又⁠有几条小鱼；耶⁠稣祝了福，就吩⁠咐也摆在众⁠人面⁠前。"
  },
  "mark.8.p4.b1": {
    "text": "众人都吃，并且吃饱了，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "众⁠人都吃，并⁠且吃饱了，"
  },
  "mark.8.p4.b2": {
    "text": "收拾剩下的零碎，有七筐子。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "收⁠拾剩⁠下的零⁠碎，有七筐⁠子。"
  },
  "mark.8.p4.b3": {
    "text": "人数约有四千。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "人⁠数约有四⁠千。"
  },
  "mark.8.p4.b4": {
    "text": "随即同门徒上船，来到大玛努他境内。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "随⁠即同门⁠徒上⁠船，来⁠到大⁠玛努⁠他境⁠内。"
  },
  "mark.8.p5.b1": {
    "text": "法利赛人出来盘问耶稣，求他从天上显个神迹给他们看，想要试探他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "法⁠利⁠赛人出⁠来盘⁠问耶⁠稣，求他从天⁠上显个神⁠迹给他⁠们看，想⁠要试⁠探他。"
  },
  "mark.8.p5.b2": {
    "text": "这世代为什么求神迹呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这世⁠代为⁠什⁠么求神⁠迹呢？"
  },
  "mark.8.p5.b3": {
    "text": "我实在告诉你们，没有神迹给这世代看。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我实⁠在告⁠诉你⁠们，没⁠有神⁠迹给这世⁠代看。"
  },
  "mark.8.p5.b4": {
    "text": "他就离开他们，又上船往海那边去了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他就离⁠开他⁠们，又上⁠船往海那⁠边去⁠了。"
  },
  "mark.8.p6.b1": {
    "text": "门徒忘了带饼；在船上除了一个饼，没有别的食物。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "门⁠徒忘⁠了带饼；在船⁠上除⁠了一⁠个饼，没⁠有别⁠的食⁠物。"
  },
  "mark.8.p6.b2": {
    "text": "你们要谨慎，防备法利赛人的酵和希律的酵。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们要谨⁠慎，防⁠备法⁠利⁠赛人的酵和希⁠律的酵。"
  },
  "mark.8.p6.b3": {
    "text": "这是因为我们没有饼吧。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这是因⁠为我⁠们没⁠有饼吧。"
  },
  "mark.8.p7.b1": {
    "text": "你们为什么因为没有饼就议论呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们为⁠什⁠么因⁠为没⁠有饼就议⁠论呢？"
  },
  "mark.8.p7.b2": {
    "text": "你们还不省悟，还不明白吗？你们的心还是愚顽吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们还不省⁠悟，还不明⁠白吗？你⁠们的心还⁠是愚顽吗？"
  },
  "mark.8.p7.b3": {
    "text": "你们有眼睛，看不见吗？有耳朵，听不见吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们有眼⁠睛，看⁠不⁠见吗？有耳⁠朵，听不⁠见吗？"
  },
  "mark.8.p7.b4": {
    "text": "也不记得吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "也⁠不记⁠得吗？"
  },
  "mark.8.p8.b1": {
    "text": "我擘开那五个饼分给五千人，你们收拾的零碎装满了多少篮子呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我擘开那五个饼分给五⁠千人，你⁠们收⁠拾的零⁠碎装⁠满了多⁠少篮⁠子呢？"
  },
  "mark.8.p8.b2": {
    "text": "十二个。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "十⁠二⁠个。"
  },
  "mark.8.p8.b3": {
    "text": "七个。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "七⁠个。"
  },
  "mark.8.p8.b4": {
    "text": "你们还是不明白吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们还⁠是不明⁠白吗？"
  },
  "mark.8.p9.b1": {
    "text": "他们来到伯赛大，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们来⁠到伯⁠赛⁠大，"
  },
  "mark.8.p9.b2": {
    "text": "有人带一个瞎子来，求耶稣摸他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有⁠人带一⁠个瞎⁠子来，求耶⁠稣摸他。"
  },
  "mark.8.p9.b3": {
    "text": "耶稣拉着瞎子的手，领他到村外，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣拉着瞎⁠子的手，领他到村外，"
  },
  "mark.8.p9.b4": {
    "text": "你看见什么了？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你看⁠见什⁠么了？"
  },
  "mark.8.p10.b1": {
    "text": "我看见人了；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我看⁠见人了；"
  },
  "mark.8.p10.b2": {
    "text": "他们好像树木，并且行走。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们好⁠像树⁠木，并⁠且行⁠走。"
  },
  "mark.8.p11.b1": {
    "text": "随后又按手在他眼睛上，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "随⁠后又按手在他眼⁠睛上，"
  },
  "mark.8.p11.b2": {
    "text": "他定睛一看，就复了原，样样都看得清楚了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他定⁠睛一⁠看，就复了原，样⁠样都看⁠得清⁠楚了。"
  },
  "mark.8.p11.b3": {
    "text": "连这村子你也不要进去。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "连这村⁠子你也不⁠要进⁠去。"
  },
  "mark.8.p12.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣和门徒出去，往凯撒利亚·腓立比村庄去；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣和门⁠徒出⁠去，往凯撒利⁠亚·腓⁠立⁠比村⁠庄去；"
  },
  "mark.8.p12.b2": {
    "text": "人说我是谁？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "人说我⁠是谁？"
  },
  "mark.8.p12.b3": {
    "text": "有人说是施洗的约翰；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有⁠人说是施⁠洗的约⁠翰；"
  },
  "mark.8.p12.b4": {
    "text": "有人说是以利亚；又有人说是先知里的一位。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有⁠人说是以⁠利⁠亚；又⁠有人说是先⁠知里的一⁠位。"
  },
  "mark.8.p13.b1": {
    "text": "你们说我是谁？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们说我⁠是谁？"
  },
  "mark.8.p13.b2": {
    "text": "你是基督。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠是基⁠督。"
  },
  "mark.8.p13.b3": {
    "text": "耶稣就禁戒他们，不要告诉人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣就禁戒他⁠们，不⁠要告⁠诉人。"
  },
  "mark.8.p14.b1": {
    "text": "从此，他教训他们说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "从⁠此，他教⁠训他⁠们说："
  },
  "mark.8.p14.b2": {
    "text": "人子必须受许多的苦，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "人⁠子必⁠须受许⁠多的苦，"
  },
  "mark.8.p14.b3": {
    "text": "被长老、祭司长，和文士弃绝，并且被杀，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "被长⁠老、祭⁠司⁠长，和文⁠士弃⁠绝，并⁠且被杀，"
  },
  "mark.8.p14.b4": {
    "text": "过三天复活。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "过三⁠天复⁠活。"
  },
  "mark.8.p15.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣明明地说这话，彼得就拉着他，劝他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣明⁠明地说这话，彼⁠得就拉着他，劝他。"
  },
  "mark.8.p15.b2": {
    "text": "撒但，退我后边去吧！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "撒⁠但，退我后⁠边去吧！"
  },
  "mark.8.p15.b3": {
    "text": "因为你不体贴神的意思，只体贴人的意思。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠为你不体⁠贴神的意⁠思，只体⁠贴人⁠的意⁠思。"
  },
  "mark.8.p16.b1": {
    "text": "于是叫众人和门徒来，对他们说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "于⁠是叫众⁠人和门⁠徒来，对他⁠们说："
  },
  "mark.8.p16.b2": {
    "text": "若有人要跟从我，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "若⁠有人要跟从我，"
  },
  "mark.8.p16.b3": {
    "text": "就当舍己，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就当舍⁠己，"
  },
  "mark.8.p16.b4": {
    "text": "背起他的十字架来跟从我。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "背⁠起他⁠的十⁠字⁠架来跟从我。"
  },
  "mark.8.p17.b1": {
    "text": "因为，凡要救自己生命的，必丧掉生命；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠为，凡要救自⁠己生⁠命的，必丧掉生⁠命；"
  },
  "mark.8.p17.b2": {
    "text": "凡为我和福音丧掉生命的，必救了生命。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "凡为⁠我和福⁠音丧掉生⁠命的，必救了生⁠命。"
  },
  "mark.8.p17.b3": {
    "text": "人就是赚得全世界，赔上自己的生命，有什么益处呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "人就⁠是赚⁠得全⁠世⁠界，赔⁠上自⁠己的生⁠命，有什⁠么益⁠处呢？"
  },
  "mark.8.p17.b4": {
    "text": "人还能拿什么换生命呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "人还能拿什⁠么换生⁠命呢？"
  },
  "mark.8.p18.b1": {
    "text": "凡在这淫乱罪恶的世代，把我和我的道当作可耻的，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "凡⁠在这淫⁠乱罪⁠恶的世⁠代，把我和我⁠的道当⁠作可⁠耻的，"
  },
  "mark.8.p18.b2": {
    "text": "人子在他父的荣耀里，同圣天使降临的时候，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "人⁠子在他父的荣⁠耀里，同圣天⁠使降⁠临的时⁠候，"
  },
  "mark.8.p18.b3": {
    "text": "也要把那人当作可耻的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 8:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "也⁠要把那人当⁠作可⁠耻的。"
  }
}
